submissions/**/*.zip

# IMPORTANT: keep lightweight scientific evidence versioned.
# Do NOT ignore:
#   private-official.json
#   reports/**/*.json, *.jsonl, *.csv, *.md
#   results/**/MANIFEST.json, REPORT*.json, REPORT*.md, metrics/config files
#   submissions/**/submission.json, MANIFEST.json, README.md, HYPOTHESIS.md
#
# If a results/ artifact becomes large, add that exact path here rather than
# ignoring the entire results/ tree.
